<view class="page login-page">
  <view class="brand-block">
    <view class="brand-mark">国康</view>
    <view>
      <view class="page-title">直营团队日常管理</view>
      <view class="page-subtitle">销售、库存、提成、客情与仓库回款</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!configured}}" class="section">
    <view class="section-title danger-text">还差一步配置</view>
    <view class="hint">请先按照部署手册，把云开发环境ID填写到 miniprogram/config.js，然后重新编译。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="section login-form">
    <view class="section-title">账号登录</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">账号</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入分配的账号" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">密码</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="onInput" password maxlength="128" placeholder="请输入密码" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn primary full" bindtap="submit">登录</button>
    <view class="hint top-space">首次登录必须修改初始密码。忘记密码时，请联系老板在人员管理中重置。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{configured}}" class="section">
    <view class="section-title">只在第一次部署时使用</view>
    <view class="hint">云函数和数据库刚部署完成、还没有任何账号时，点击下面按钮。成功一次后会自动禁止再次初始化。</view>
    <button class="btn full top-space" bindtap="initialize">初始化数据库和账号</button>
  </view>
</view>
